# K95 ERP Project Overview

## Project Type

This repository is a Vite + React frontend for the K95 ERP application. It was generated/exported from Base44 and uses the Base44 SDK for authentication, data entities, file uploads, and serverless functions.

The local app runs in the browser at:

```text
http://127.0.0.1:5173
```

